WEBVTT

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:17.120
I know this looks bad, Team, but the Super Robot must be clean!

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.110
You gonna talk all day or do this?

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:24.570
Last one to finish his side does the other's chores.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:25.670
You're on.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:11.450
okay buddy what happened to you he lost check it out my side sparkles the kid

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:14.180
missed a spot

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:30.000
sore loser who was that girl while exploring the outskirts of the city I discovered an

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:37.020
super robot it was then my life was transformed by the mysterious power the robot monkeys were

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:43.380
awakened and i shiro made their leader our quest save sugarzoom city from the evils of the skeleton king

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:45.840
super robot monkey team hyperbole

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:28.070
of wonky jungle rat?

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.170
Yeah, figures the monkey kid would protect her.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:36.920
Monkey boy for a monkey girl.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.050
Monkey girl?

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:45.580
Thank you.

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.840
My name is Jinmei.

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:48.030
I'm new in town.

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:51.110
Um, me, I, uh, Chiros.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:52.930
Where are you from?

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:55.250
I'm from...

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:59.440
Hiya, Fuzzball.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:05.730
Sako I think he likes you I think I like him too

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:11.790
Anyone seen Chiro? He missed his tactics lesson.

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:13.850
The kid blew off pilot training, too.

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:16.650
And he was supposed to aid me in rewiring the robots.

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:24.080
Not that I needed his help.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:25.700
I'll try the communicator.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:27.620
Monkey Team to Chiro.

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:29.650
Monkey Team to Chiro.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:38.150
He's not responding I get the feeling he's ignoring us

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:43.360
he probably just has something important to do and what pray tell is more

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:52.590
important than the team a skeleton King horde is headed for the city it's a big

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:56.980
one we can't activate the robot without Chiro we'll have to fight without it

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:29.190
- It is.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:44.340
bow to my will or send out your monkeys to their fate

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:30.000
Facing superior numbers, logic dictates the use of environment

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.940
to one's advantage

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:07.620
without the boy.

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:09.250
Bonehead is right.

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:10.230
We need Chirro.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:11.190
He'll be here.

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:12.490
I hope so.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.150
Monkey Team to Chirro.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:50.420
- Right.

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:16.710
you left me some bad guys. What are friends for? We missed you, Chiro.

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:21.080
Uh, yeah. No time to explain. We got Bone drones to battle!

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:22.210
LIGHTNING!

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:38.200
Show off.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.510
- That's right, you better booze away.

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:04.590
- The kid ditched us again.

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:06.950
- Not this time.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.530
- So, you like my moves?

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:13.590
- I wasn't impressed.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:16.270
I thought you were great before.

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:21.030
- Chiru, report to base now.

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:22.270
- Thought you wouldn't understand,

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:23.570
so I kept a little secret.

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:24.890
What's the big deal?

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:26.170
- We're a team.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:28.190
We don't keep secrets from each other.

00:09:28.190 --> 00:09:30.000
- Okay, fine, then I have another secret.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.000
Jinmay is coming over to meet you all.

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:35.950
Impossible.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.950
No outsider has ever set foot in a super robot.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:39.950
Too late.

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:41.030
She's here.

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:45.060
This is Jinmay.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:49.510
Nova, wow, you got a good grip.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.970
Oh, you're adorable.

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:53.970
I go by Otto.

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:57.840
Name's SBRX-77, but you can call me Spice.

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:00.000
I am Mr. Hal Gibson.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:03.140
Do not call me Lister or Hal, just Gibson, please.

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:06.640
I am best known as Antari, second in command of...

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:12.710
I have no idea what they're saying.

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:14.190
But I love them.

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:16.280
Look how cute you are.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:19.500
What's this thing?

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:20.060
Hello?

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:24.460
That's my monkey translator.

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:28.370
When it's done, you and everyone will be able to understand the monkeys, too.

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:29.290
I can't wait.

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:30.000
In the meantime,

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:31.700
It made you something.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:33.080
Hold out your hand.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:34.460
Close your eyes.

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:40.410
I love it.

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:50.920
Hey, there's Socko.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:52.880
Where'd you go off to, little guy?

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:54.720
Socko is tired.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:55.600
We should go.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.020
I don't want to say goodbye.

00:10:57.610 --> 00:10:58.070
Then don't.

00:10:58.400 --> 00:10:59.020
See you tomorrow.

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:08.190
Hate to spoil the mood, but apparently a silent alarm was triggered during Jin Mei's visit.

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:14.010
Oh, looks like Jin Mei's cute little guy just got lost.

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:18.370
That's not the bathroom!

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:23.070
Oh, and look at the little guy hacker computer.

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:30.000
A cute little spy downloaded the super robot's battle specifications.

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:48.730
He deserves it, the little spy.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:51.580
Spy? What are you talking about?

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.560
Oh, yeah, that's good.

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:56.120
Little Miss Innocent. Nice act.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.970
Why are you being so mean?

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:00.000
I don't like being lied to by my friends.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:00.570
friends

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:02.880
I'm not lying

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:05.420
I don't like this game Chiro

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:08.590
it's no game

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:17.560
not everything my king

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:19.840
he doesn't know her secrets

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:24.030
Sako you can talk

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:26.830
come in Jinmei

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:28.600
come in there is someone

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.000
I would like you to meet

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:55.670
what's going on there's no mere monkey and you my dear are not even

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:10.450
It was I who found you, pulled you from the void, cleansed your memory and gave you a purpose.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:13.340
To defeat Chirro!

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:16.460
But... I like Chirro.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:21.650
Well, Chirro doesn't like you. Found out you're a robot.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:29.890
I know that hurts, but don't worry. I'll give you the means to get even.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:38.940
The destruction of the super robot monkey team.

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:59.380
It wasn't for you. It really let you down.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:04.410
Aw, just because a friend makes a mistake, doesn't mean you give up on them.

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:06.440
We got your back.

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:07.440
Bet on it!

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:13.090
A monster alert! The city is under siege! Again!

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:15.650
Let's go pound some bad guys!

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:36.170
Crusher Cruiser 5, go!

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:37.990
Fist Rocket 4, go!

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.790
Fist Rocket 3, go!

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:41.810
Brain Scrappler Pilot 2, go!

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:44.660
Torso Tank Driver 1, go!

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:48.620
Bird!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:49.000
Robot!

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:49.280
Monkey!

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:49.940
Piper!

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:50.380
False!

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:50.940
Go!

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:58.180
Target directly ahead.

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:30.000
about that jimmy she's a robot i knew there was something about her getting our weakness

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.000
Misses, prepare for counterattack!

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:38.970
Chiro, what are your orders?

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:42.710
Okay, okay, we fight back! Launch mega missiles!

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:07.620
Pardon me.

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:10.630
Lasertron Yuri!

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:19.810
I've got her in my sights.

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:34.260
I'm on him.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:40.890
Monkeys.

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.550
So overrated.

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:24.390
We can't hold a bridge and protect ourselves.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.500
I know.

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:49.300
It's me, Kiro. Remember, you and me? The ice cream shop? Gorilla suits? There was something. A little? Maybe? No more secrets, Jinmay. I promise.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:53.250
Kiro?

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:55.320
Kiro!

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:02.840
Because I control him.

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:08.800
Monkey Team, I think Socko needs a spanking.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:42.180
- I know you need to find out where you came from,

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.340
who you are.

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:45.730
- Maybe you could hold onto this for me.

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:47.050
- Don't you need it?

00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:51.200
- I got something better now.

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:53.120
I don't wanna say goodbye.

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:54.860
- Then don't.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:57.430
- See ya, someday.

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:21.530
Or I ask my king is one more opportunity?

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:23.370
You've had your chance.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:25.600
I won't trust you with another.

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:45.780
I almost forgot.

00:19:50.320 --> 00:19:59.130
One day, Chiro. One day.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:02.240
We'll be right back.
